# sdist 里要带上**打包本身需要的东西**,不然从 sdist 建 wheel 会失败。
#
# 两样:in-tree 的构建后端,和浏览器端的源码。
# 建好的 `webmuxd/_client/` 由 package-data 带进来 ——
# **所以从 sdist 装的人不需要 Node**(见 _build/backend.py)。
include _build/backend.py
recursive-include webmuxjs *.ts *.json *.html *.md *.gitignore
exclude webmuxjs/client/package-lock.json
exclude webmuxjs/sidecar/package-lock.json
exclude webmuxjs/extension/package-lock.json
prune webmuxjs/client/node_modules
prune webmuxjs/client/dist
prune webmuxjs/sidecar/node_modules
prune webmuxjs/sidecar/dist
prune webmuxjs/extension/node_modules
prune webmuxjs/extension/dist

recursive-include docs *.md
include tests/README.md
